    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66135" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελίχρως</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωτος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>honey-coloured</i>, i. e.
				<i>with olive complexion</i>, freq. in Pap., as <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.8
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				7169.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.170
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Diosc.
			</span></i>): also acc. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελίχροας</span>
			<i>honey-coloured</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					3.224
				</span></i>
			; of complexion, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				144
			</span></i>: dat. sg. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελίχροϊ, νέκταρι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tryph.
					113
				</span></i>
			.</div>
